  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educational program with practical training in the management of natural resources in Chinameca, El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin para el Desarrollo de Chinameca (ASDECHI) will provide training on agroecological practices for small-scale farmers in the municipality of Chinameca El Salvador. Project activities will center on families with an emphasis on the participation of young people who will learn how to reduce the use of agrochemicals to improve the quality of their production and increase its yield. This project will benefit 950 Salvadorians directly and 1700 more indirectly. ..</narrative>
  </description>
